[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18601.75, "timestamp": "05:10:01", "text": "现在就杀了你。你走了。你将会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18604.868, "timestamp": "05:10:04", "text": "走了。等等，让我想想办法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18611.03, "timestamp": "05:10:11", "text": "即将到来。对，跳起来，然后按W键。按住W键。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18615.51, "timestamp": "05:10:15", "text": "哦，我在这里还看到一颗祖母绿。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18619.35, "timestamp": "05:10:19", "text": "好的。这里是网络。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18622.628, "timestamp": "05:10:22", "text": "什么？这是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18625.39, "timestamp": "05:10:25", "text": "这。这里为什么会有云？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18634.55, "timestamp": "05:10:34", "text": "视频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18637.51, "timestamp": "05:10:37", "text": "嗯，你可以像这样坐着打空气。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18639.75, "timestamp": "05:10:39", "text": "就好像我们坐在水中一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18642.31, "timestamp": "05:10:42", "text": "按摩浴缸。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18650.15, "timestamp": "05:10:50", "text": "但也挺不错的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18656.63, "timestamp": "05:10:56", "text": "那么，我们应该教他什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18659.43, "timestamp": "05:10:59", "text": "[音乐]"}]